  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening coordination of EU integration processes in Federation BIH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strengthening coordination of EU integration processes in Federation BIH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal is defined as follows: Improved capacity of the Government of the Federation of BiH in regard of its capability to implement and monitor the Stabilizationa and Association Agreement. Developed and established procedures and rules for horizontal coordination of the Federal administration bodies. Coordinated preparation of the strategic documents in BiH regarding EU integration process. Strengthened human and technical (IT) capacities of the Office for EU integration within the Fedeation BiH Government. Fulfilled of the conditions that relate to the BiH-EU Stabilization and Association Agreement</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att ge st&#xf6;d till BiH Federala regering f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka kapacitet inom EU integrering genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla med 3 konsulter under perioden p&#xe5; tv&#xe5; &#xe5;r samt till begr&#xe4;nsad kontorsutrustning.

Federationen BiH st&#xe5;r inf&#xf6;r stora utmaningar i samordning med federala ministerier och andra organ inom verksamhet, implementering och rapporteringskrave enligt EU: s stabiliserings- och associeringsavtal samt inom samordning av EU-fr&#xe5;geformul&#xe4;ret.

Det tillf&#xe4;lliga st&#xf6;det beg&#xe4;rs av den nuvarande premi&#xe4;rministerns kabinett direkt till Sveriges ambassad i BH.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to provide support to the Federation BH Government to
increase the capacity of its Office for EU integrations, by providing up to 3 Consultants/
trainers for a period of two years and limited office Equipment.
The Government of the Federation BH entity is facing significant challenges in coordinating
with federal ministries and other bodies, in activities, supervision and reporting requirements
under EU stabiliation and association agreement and additionally with coordination of the
EU questionnaire.
The temporary support is requested by the current Prime Minister cabinet directly to the
Ambassador of Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
